  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 705.04 Employee Cafeteria Operators. Employers operating cafeterias, where taxable meals are sold, shall obtain a meals and rentals tax operator’s license.\n\nSource. #6690, eff 2-21-98; ss by #6750, eff 5-19-98; amd by #6870, eff 10-20-98; ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 703.03); ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
